# Build output of `breath`. Written by the two-step build documented in
# AGENTS.md — `wasm-bindgen` writes the two wasm artefacts into `dist/`, then
# `build.rs` publishes the rest of the site — and reproducible from the
# committed sources. Never committed: a committed build is a build that rots
# silently, shipping a pacer that predates the code that produced it.
dist/
